# Ames Housing V3

On 1,168 development homes, each predicted twice outside training, V3 achieved **{outer_v3_rmsle:.5f} RMSLE** and **{outer_v3_mae} MAE**. The nested V2 comparator achieved **{outer_v2_rmsle:.5f}** and **{outer_v2_mae}**. The signed relative RMSLE reduction was **{outer_gain:.2f}%** (conditional 95% interval {rmsle_ci_low:.2f}% to {rmsle_ci_high:.2f}%). MAE changed by **{mae_change:+.2f}%** (interval {mae_ci_low:.2f}% to {mae_ci_high:.2f}%). V3 **{promotion}** the predeclared promotion conditions.

The [release comparison](../README.md#v1-v2-ve-v3-aynı-292-evde) uses the corrected five-fold V2 on 292 sales. The comparator in this technical report is independently tuned on three inner folds within each training split. [Portfolio](https://alperdigital.github.io/ML/) · [Project methods and decisions in Turkish](https://alperdigital.github.io/ML/proje-detaylari.html)

